    {
      "id": "_ywwz_CtZIWSp99dU_mD4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 736.6546263684295,
      "y": 451.34292717397636,
      "width": 722.897812590283,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eebefa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1423259250,
      "version": 2153,
      "versionNonce": 173329024,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1765506741032,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) Non Functional Requirements (SPARCS):  \n- Scalability: around 2B DAU, system should be able to handle this. \n- Latency: near realtime(<500ms) message transfer\n- Availability: higher preference over consistency\n- reliability: guarantees delivery of messages\n- fault tolerant, messages not stored unnecessarily,\n \n\n3) Core Entities \n- User\n- Chat \n- Message \n- files\n- client => multiple devices\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) Non Functional Requirements (SPARCS):  \n- Scalability: around 2B DAU, system should be able to handle this. \n- Latency: near realtime(<500ms) message transfer\n- Availability: higher preference over consistency\n- reliability: guarantees delivery of messages\n- fault tolerant, messages not stored unnecessarily,\n \n\n3) Core Entities \n- User\n- Chat \n- Message \n- files\n- client => multiple devices\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "A2P4AILlBEj0BXizHjARR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 735.6651682414763,
      "y": 813.1344386891659,
      "width": 715.3343118260382,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eebefa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 408070254,
      "version": 1722,
      "versionNonce": 1080671616,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1765506106158,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4) API Design \n\nNote that for this given problem we are using web sockets hence can't\nfollow the same rest API template. \n\n- Commands sent \n    : createChat\n    : sendMessage \n    : createAttachment \n    : modifyParticipants \n\n- Commands Received \n    : receiveMessage \n    : chatUpdate \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4) API Design \n\nNote that for this given problem we are using web sockets hence can't follow the same rest API template. \n\n- Commands sent \n    : createChat\n    : sendMessage \n    : createAttachment \n    : modifyParticipants \n\n- Commands Received \n    : receiveMessage \n    : chatUpdate \n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
